From bd4f029b4636603d20e7473707262c57765f1d38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fuhanfeng <michael.fhf@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 20:45:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wip(TASK-E2B-001): source flash pins from the archive in
 hand, not from constants
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Incomplete — see the session report. Import and plan work end to end for an
arbitrary build (7.0.0.37 verified on device-less paths); 10 tests still pin
the removed behaviour and post-flash verification now needs I/O at
materialization time, which is a real regression to fix before this ships.
